{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17421","headline":"赠郑国庄穆公主挽歌二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"赠郑国庄穆公主挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"追饰崇汤沐，遗芳蔼禁闱。\n秋原森羽卫，夜壑掩容辉。\n睿藻悲难尽，公宫望不归。\n笳箫向烟雾，疑是彩鸾飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}